<title>USA: Invivo says Q4 results below expectations.</title>
<headline>Invivo says Q4 results below expectations.</headline>
<dateline>PLEASANTON, Calif 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Invivo Corp said Thursday it will report an operating loss for the fourth quarter, and revenues will be below expectations at about $8.5 million compared to $7.78 million for the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>The quarter ended June 30.</p>
<p>The company said international revenues for its medical device subsidiary, Invivo Research, were off &quot;substantially&quot; as compared to the previous quarter ended March 31.</p>
<p>The company's safety and industrial businesses performed to expectations in the fourth quarter.</p>
